  <section class="faq" id="faq">
    <div class="faq-inner">
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently asked</h2>
      <div class="faq-list">

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Is it really free? What's the catch?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            Completely free. No freemium tiers, no premium unlocks, no ads. We're in open beta and funded out of pocket while we find a sustainable model that doesn't involve selling your data or attention. We'll be transparent if that ever changes — but "free for students" is a core principle, not a growth tactic.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">How is this different from LinkedIn?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            LinkedIn is for professional networking and recruiters. Kampus Connect is for students right now — finding project partners, study groups, language exchange buddies, mentors inside your cohort. No job postings, no sponsored content, no HR. Just people your age doing interesting things at campus.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Which universities are supported?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            Anyone with a valid .edu or university email can register. We don't restrict by institution. As the community grows, we'll add university-specific spaces and verified badges for institution affiliation.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Can I add skills I'm still learning?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            Yes — and we encourage it. Every skill has a level: Beginner, Intermediate, or Advanced. Being a beginner is valuable. Someone teaching you is how knowledge spreads across campus. Honesty is the whole point.
          </div>
        </details>

        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary class="faq-q">Is my data private?</summary>
          <div class="faq-a">
            Your profile is visible to other registered students. We don't sell data to third parties, we don't run ads, and we don't build behavioral profiles for advertisers. Your data is used only to make the product work.
          </div>
        </details>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

